  "language": "en",
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "heading": "Main article",
      "text": "You can apply for vouchers for the journals of the Royal Society of Chemistry as well as for F1000 Research at the E-Publishing Office of ETH-Bibliothek.\n\nFor the journals of the Electrochemical Society , a free \"article credit\" will be activated, as soon as you choose the open-access option and give your affiliation to ETH Zurich when submitting your manuscript.\n\nPublishing in open-access journals: Funding"
    }
